hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"445.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"445.2","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar from Abdullah ibn Abbas that he said: The sun eclipsed, so the Messenger of Allah ﷺ prayed and the people prayed with him. He stood a long standing, approximately the length of Surat al-Baqarah. Then he bowed a long bowing. Then he raised his head and stood a long standing, though it was shorter than the first standing. Then he bowed a long bowing, though it was shorter than the first bowing. Then he prostrated. Then he stood a long standing, though it was shorter than the first standing. Then he bowed a long bowing, though it was shorter than the first bowing. Then he raised his head and stood a long standing, though it was shorter than the first standing. Then he bowed a long bowing, though it was shorter than the first bowing. Then he prostrated. Then he departed, and the sun had become clear. He said: ""The sun and the moon are two signs among the signs of Allah; they do not eclipse for the death of anyone nor for his life. So when you see that, remember Allah."" They said: ""O Messenger of Allah, we saw you reach for something at your place, then we saw you recoil."" He said: ""I saw Paradise, so I reached for a cluster from it. Had I taken it, you would have eaten from it as long as the world remained. And I saw the Fire, and I have never seen a sight more horrifying than today, and I saw that most of its inhabitants were women."" They said: ""Why, O Messenger of Allah?"" He said: ""Because of their ingratitude (kufr)."" It was said: ""Do they disbelieve in Allah?"" He said: ""They are ungrateful to their husbands and ungrateful for good treatment. If you were to treat one of them well for an entire lifetime, then she saw something from you, she would say: 'I have never seen any good from you at all.'"""
"446.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"446.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"447.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from 'Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman from A'isha"
"447.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from 'Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman from A'isha"
"448.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from Fatima bint al Mundhir that Asma bint Abi Bakr as-Siddiq said"
"448.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from Fatima bint al Mundhir that Asma bint Abi Bakr as-Siddiq said"
